        "reason": "Offline review of publisher race/class tables, class deep dives, current launch-client skill reporting, and the registered leveling guides. Armor unlocks are 40; Rogue dual wield is 10 and Warrior/Hunter dual wield 20; polearms have a 20 gate. Rogues gain one-handed axes. Feral weapon DPS and weapon effects remain relevant in forms. Unconfirmed Shaman dual wield and Druid polearms are excluded from these conservative recommendation policies. Alternative supported weapon training is a proficiency requirement, not an assertion that the character already knows the skill. Target build is review context; offline review is not live gameplay acceptance. Assassination retains daggers in both weapon slots so its Backstab/Mutilate playstyle remains supported without assuming a particular Legacy talent unlock. QuestieDB documents race IDs 95/96 as mask bits 32/33; do not derive their masks as race ID minus one.",
